OL,3,GNEWSACo-op smashed as raiders target
OL,4,Acash machine
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe front entrance of a Co-op in
OL,7,Fcentral Cambridge has been badly
OL,8,Fdamaged, as raiders tried to tear a
OL,9,Fcash machine from the store.
OL,11,FIt happened at the Mitcham's Corner
OL,12,Fbranch on Milton Road at about 04:00
OL,13,FGMT.
OL,15,FCambridgeshire Police said a stolen red
OL,16,FLand Rover was used in the attempted
OL,17,Ftheft and abandoned at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
